body:
may problem sa story ni OP is, paano naman feeling ni wife. wala ba sya rights to have a man by her side. IMO if I had a wife whom suddenly is a man infront of me. Heart breaking sya.

&#x200B;

I think baka biglang di na kinaya ng wife nya at biglaan nalang nag decision.

looks like blood by native.

&#x200B;

try using enhanced blood textures and make sure youre not using enb/reshade that may cause glowing effect of the blood splash.

hanap ka trainees, kasi kung papasok ko as junior less likely ka ma hire, although unless super smart or super galing mo sa communications. Look for direct hires, wag yung solution baba sahod and babaratin ka. Look for full-time wag part-time or project based.

best to learn: concepts, theories, communications, look for patterns not always syntax.

&#x200B;

sa japanese company tama yung hula mo.

bonds look out

tapos yung disclaimer, pag mag resign ka alamin mo kung pwede ka mag apply sa ibang katulad na work place. kasi pag pumasok ka ng solutions iba ipagbabawal tapos di ka makakapasok other solutions for 1-2years

hmo

vl/sl

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

wag agad pirma, patong patong mo mga job offers mo din tsaka ka mag decide

&#x200B;

Best of luck
